  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Special DGT authorization required for testing automated vehicles on open roads; valid max 2 years, renewable.",
   "Vehicles must be certified by a designated Technological Recognition Centre (ENAC ISO 17025 accredited) or hold equivalent EU authorization.",
   "Mandatory insurance covering civil liability, and DSSAD or EDR data recorder.",
   "A trained operator must be able to take full control at all times, in-vehicle or remotely.",
   "Annex V sets dynamic tests: override, emergency braking, lane control, signal recognition, HARA/FMEA risk assessment, cybersecurity."
